{
  "id": "cors-one-site",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Tek siteye izin",
    "en": "Allowing one site"
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "language": "python",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "entry": "main.py",
  "files": [
    {
      "name": "main.py",
      "starter": "starter-main.{lang}.py",
      "solution": "solution-main.py"
    }
  ],
  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`app.add_middleware(CORSMiddleware, allow_origins=[...], allow_methods=[\"GET\"], allow_headers=[\"*\"])`.",
      "en": "`app.add_middleware(CORSMiddleware, allow_origins=[...], allow_methods=[\"GET\"], allow_headers=[\"*\"])`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\nfrom fastapi.middleware.cors import CORSMiddleware\n\napp = FastAPI()\napp.add_middleware(\n    CORSMiddleware,\n    allow_origins=[\"https://library.example.com\"],\n    allow_methods=[\"GET\"],\n    allow_headers=[\"*\"],\n)\n\n\n@app.get(\"/books\")\ndef list_books():\n    return [\"Dune\", \"Emma\"]\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\nfrom fastapi.middleware.cors import CORSMiddleware\n\napp = FastAPI()\napp.add_middleware(\n    CORSMiddleware,\n    allow_origins=[\"https://library.example.com\"],\n    allow_methods=[\"GET\"],\n    allow_headers=[\"*\"],\n)\n\n\n@app.get(\"/books\")\ndef list_books():\n    return [\"Dune\", \"Emma\"]\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "http",
      "steps": [
        {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/books",
          "headers": {
            "Origin": "https://library.example.com"
          },
          "expect": {
            "status": 200,
            "json": [
              "Dune",
              "Emma"
            ],
            "headers": {
              "access-control-allow-origin": "https://library.example.com"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "method": "OPTIONS",
          "path": "/books",
          "headers": {
            "Origin": "https://library.example.com",
            "Access-Control-Request-Method": "GET"
          },
          "expect": {
            "status": 200,
            "headers": {
              "access-control-allow-methods": "GET"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "method": "OPTIONS",
          "path": "/books",
          "headers": {
            "Origin": "https://evil.example.com",
            "Access-Control-Request-Method": "GET"
          },
          "expect": {
            "status": 400
          }
        },
        {
          "method": "OPTIONS",
          "path": "/books",
          "headers": {
            "Origin": "https://library.example.com",
            "Access-Control-Request-Method": "DELETE"
          },
          "expect": {
            "status": 400
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
